{"ts":"2026-09-05T20:35:58.868Z","author":"codex","author_source":"configured","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"59a3f96f5752cae67ab54712","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.261","source":"probe"}},"op":"close","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-05T20:35:58.868Z"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/status","value":"closed"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/closed_at","value":"2026-09-05T20:35:58.834Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/completed_at","value":"2026-09-05T20:35:58.834Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/resolution","value":"fixed"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A publish routed through any declaration keyword or a braced expansion is audited, and an attested sibling in the same file cannot cover for it."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"readonly, declare, typeset and local left the binding unindexed and the publish invisible, and a braced expansion in command position split into three words and read as a command named publish; with an attested sibling present the gate reported every invocation as attested."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"Two independent fixes, each verified load-bearing by reverting it alone. The candidate loop now audits a command position that still holds an expansion rather than skipping it, which is the property itself rather than a list of keywords, so a shape nobody has enumerated is covered too. The tokenizer consumes a balanced parameter expansion as one word. All 273 tests pass and release:check passes end to end; the repository's own release workflow still passes the tightened gate."}],"before_hash":"d6a5c6b59f716c8b95c3a64d8b0befa3df9ba369b84f35c9fb2c3895d8cb17b1","after_hash":"2cc4fde3ef836